Scope
-----

These files contain metadata only: indicator names, descriptions, the
sources PORDATA credits, update dates and links. **No PORDATA data
values are contained in or redistributed by this repository** — the
values stay on PORDATA's pages and at the official sources (INE,
Eurostat, Banco de Portugal).

The metadata is derived from PORDATA's public indicator pages. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Fundação Francisco
Manuel dos Santos.
